# Exact integer-hash options of the remaining sin-hash nodes (after test_legacy_noise_hash.gd):
#
#   Blend, Blend (blend2) and TEX3D Blend: a new last blend mode "Dissolve (Exact)"
#     (value dissolve_exact). It hashes the UV on a fixed grid of 16384 cells per UV unit
#     (one cell per texel up to a 16k texture) with mm_n3_hash, salt 20u, no seed (the legacy
#     Dissolve has none either). The 3D version also floors the z coordinate.
#   SDF FBM, SDF FBM2, SDF Repeat, SDF Circle Repeat: a Hash parameter (Legacy "", Exact
#     "mmxN_" prefix of the function names), hashing the integer cell index with mm_n3_hash:
#       sdf3d_fbm   (mmx5_), sdf3d_fbm2 (mmx6_): radius of the sphere of the lattice vertex
#                    i+c = 0.5*mm_n3_hash(x, y, z, seed), seed = mm_n3_seed(mod(seed*16777215, 2^24))
#       sdf3d_repeat (mmx7_): per cell variation seed rmmx7_and(cell)+seed (salt 30u) and the
#                    rotation angles (hash with seed s, salt(s,1), salt(s,2) of the integer cell)
#       sdf3d_circle_repeat (mmx8_): variation seed rmmx8_and(k/count) (salt 31u, k recovered on
#                    a grid of 65536 per unit) + seed
#
# Tests:
#   (a) headless: the generated code of the Legacy path is unchanged (BASELINE: sha256 of the
#       code generated by the nodes of git HEAD, before this change, random id replaced by "oN").
#   (b) headless: the Exact path has no sin hash and the WP5 parity lint is silent on it, and
#       Legacy is still flagged.
#   (c) GPU (run without --headless, needs dxc): GLSL (MMVoxelEval) versus the HLSL of the
#       "Unreal/Unreal Engine 5 Voxel" export compiled by DXC (-O0) and run on the GPU.

